{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Upon my knees.</b> As its Targum renders: ״ואנא ארבי״." "<b>And I too shall be built up.</b> What is the force of גַּם? She said to him: Your elder Abraham had sons from Hagar, and Hagar girded her loins against Sarah. He said to her: My elder Sarah brought her rival into her house. She said to him: If this thing is necessary, here is my maidservant." "<b>And I too shall be built up.</b> Like Sarah."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:10.488447292Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}